hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1275","\n Narrated to us Yunus bin Abd al-A'la as-Sadafi, who said: Narrated to us Ibn Wahb, and we were informed by Ibn Abd al-Hakam that Ibn Wahb informed them, saying: Eiyad bin Abdullah informed me, from Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id al-Maqburi, from Abu Hurairah (RA), that a man came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and said: \O Messenger of Allah"","" is there a specific time during the day or night in which you order"""""
